{"_id":"6a2feff92204ffbc59e5a3ba","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"k63rFXaVDUX2ZOVI_O9WG","description":"# SQLAlchemy\n\nSQLAlchemy is a Python SQL toolkit and object-relational mapper (ORM) that provides a unified interface for connecting to many database backends including PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite, and others. It is used with Pandas via `pd.read_sql()` to load query results directly into DataFrames.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"SQLAlchemy","url":"https://www.sqlalchemy.org/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb05"},{"type":"article","title":"Mastering SQLAlchemy: A Comprehensive Guide for Python Developers","url":"https://medium.com/@ramanbazhanau/mastering-sqlalchemy-a-comprehensive-guide-for-python-developers-ddb3d9f2e829","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb06"},{"type":"video","title":"SQLAlchemy: The BEST SQL Database Library in Python","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aAy-B6KPld8","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb07"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:28:41.632Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/k63rFXaVDUX2ZOVI_O9WG.md"}